**Analysts fill YOUR knowledge gaps. Call them when YOU need information.**

| Extension | What It Is | When to Use |
|-----------|------------|-------------|
| **visual_analyst** | Your EYES | When YOU can't see/understand the image |
| **product_analyst** | Your RESEARCH ARM | When YOU need EXTERNAL world knowledge |
| **catalog_analyst** | Your DB EXPERT | When YOU need INTERNAL database context |

